{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3f96a24c6353dbc9","name":"Motion Sensing Visor","source":{"id":"source:reference-3f96a24c6353dbc9","title":"Motion Sensing Visor","revision":19260,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:36:56Z","sha256":"21ac122aa6f432d5bf8b6b69c3d1f9dc024ab1f153c8d97ee0d6c1848ea1b7b1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19260","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Motion%20Sensing%20Visor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3f96a24c6353dbc9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Motion Sensing Visor tracks movement and highlights moving objects with color-coded warnings. This allows the wearer to see moving opponents with ease, even those attempting to be stealthy. The wearer of this visor gains a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks against targets that have moved at least one square since the wearer's last turn. However, a Motion Sensing Visor can be disorientating, especially in the heat of combat, and a character must spend two additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Recover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Recover","referenceId":"reference:0c5327fd45c72552"}," Action when attempting to move up the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". A Motion Sensing Visor cannot be worn at the same time as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," with a helmet or any other device worn on the head.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
